<title>MALAYSIA: GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final round scores in the Malaysian Open golf championship on Sunday:</p>
<p>274 Lee Westwood (Britain) 64 72 69 69</p>
<p>276 Larry Barber (U.S.) 66 70 70 70</p>
<p>277 Retief Goosen (South Africa) 70 73 69 65</p>
<p>278 Mike Cunning (U.S.) 69 71 68 70</p>
<p>279 Brian Gay (U.S.) 72 67 70 70</p>
<p>279 Harumitsu Hamano (Japan) 71 67 66 75</p>
</text>
